  - m_Id: 8718668325183497
    m_Localized: End Turn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183498
    m_Localized: "Looking for a free seat\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183499
    m_Localized: "Knocking on the server\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183500
    m_Localized: "Waking up the admin\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183501
    m_Localized: "Elbowing through the queue\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183502
    m_Localized: "Dusting off the database\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183503
    m_Localized: "Recounting your riches\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183504
    m_Localized: "Checking your progress hasn't run off\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183505
    m_Localized: "Digging your account out of the pile\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183506
    m_Localized: "Talking the server into letting you in\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183507
    m_Localized: "Putting the cards back in order\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183508
    m_Localized: "Looking for somewhere to plug the server in\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183509
    m_Localized: "Negotiating with the cloud\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275818459136
    m_Localized: "This is your commander. Always on hand \u2014 deploy whenever you
      feel like it. Get him killed and he's back next turn, sulking."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207872
    m_Localized: "Gold. It's what puts creatures on the board. Each turn you get
      more and it refills \u2014 hoarding is pointless, spending is a joy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207873
    m_Localized: "Drag a creature from your hand onto your front line. You can afford
      it \u2014 don't be shy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207874
    m_Localized: "A creature has three numbers. Attack \u2014 how hard it hits. Health
      \u2014 how much it takes. Speed \u2014 pay attention to this one."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207875
    m_Localized: Speed means actions, not running. A step costs speed, so does a
      hit. One attack per turn. It all refills at the start of your turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207876
    m_Localized: 'Click your creature, then an adjacent cell. A step costs speed:
      out of it? End your turn and it refills.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207877
    m_Localized: 'Reach an enemy creature and hit it: click yours, then the enemy
      next to it. Out of speed? End your turn and continue next one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207878
    m_Localized: "Mana dripped off the corpse. It pays for spells and charms. It
      doesn't appear on its own \u2014 you harvest it from enemy creatures, or by
      other tricks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207879
    m_Localized: "You've got mana \u2014 cast a spell. Spells have requirements:
      no valid target, no cast."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207880
    m_Localized: "There are also charms \u2014 permanent things, also paid in mana.
      You can't hold more than five at once."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207881
    m_Localized: Finale. Punch through to the enemy avatar and keep hitting. Out
      of speed? End your turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207882
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10032882314633216
    m_Localized: All damage taken on your turn is reflected to the opponent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10032882373353472
    m_Localized: Buy {0} for {1} {2}?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10032882373353473
    m_Localized: Max
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10032882373353474
    m_Localized: "Shred dupes (\xD7{0})"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10184817860665344
    m_Localized: The Reckless Prince
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10184817919385600
    m_Localized: 'At the start of your turn: plays the top card of your deck (targets
      are random)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10184817919385601
    m_Localized: The Fairest Princess
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10184817919385602
    m_Localized: 'At the start of the match: shuffles itself into your deck. When
      drawn: restores all your health'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10184817919385603
    m_Localized: The Local Tough
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10184817919385604
    m_Localized: 'After it survives damage: summons a deep copy of itself'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10184817919385605
    m_Localized: What a Brawl!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10184817919385606
    m_Localized: Destroy all creatures except one random
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786671362048
    m_Localized: The Fairest Princess
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665216
    m_Localized: Bruiser the Jailer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665217
    m_Localized: The Rat King
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665218
    m_Localized: Sensei Boarman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665219
    m_Localized: Moldwick the Warlock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665220
    m_Localized: The Underboss of Hell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665221
    m_Localized: Ugh. Sewers. Smells like a chemistry final.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665222
    m_Localized: The Rat King? Really? I'm allergic to monarchs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665223
    m_Localized: "Long live your rats. Too long \u2014 they keep coming back."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665224
    m_Localized: I got gnawed to bits. Literally. How embarrassing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665225
    m_Localized: "A gym? Great, I'll ask for directions. \u2026Why is everyone HUGE?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665226
    m_Localized: Billy, I don't want to compete. I want to walk PAST you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665227
    m_Localized: Counts as leg day. Never coming back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665228
    m_Localized: They pinned me. And it wasn't a wrestling move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665229
    m_Localized: The Swamp of Bad Luck. The name kind of spoils the ending.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665230
    m_Localized: Gramps, hand over the staff. It's a size too big for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665231
    m_Localized: "Peekaboo, princeling. Have a gift \u2014 breathe in my little clouds."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665232
    m_Localized: "Curses lifted. The bad luck stays \u2014 that's just my personality."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665233
    m_Localized: Seems I drew the wrong card. All of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665234
    m_Localized: The Underworld. Warm, crowded, middle management. Just like Monday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665235
    m_Localized: You're not Gnidalf. You're his contractor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665236
    m_Localized: 'Tell upstairs: the prince is coming. And he''s cranky.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665237
    m_Localized: Buried under imps. Tiny ones. Twice as insulting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665238
    m_Localized: "I last bathed a century ago. And I already won \u2014 in advance."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665239
    m_Localized: Tired, princeling? Here's some clouds for the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665240
    m_Localized: "Thanks, prince. You also\u2026 well, you can shower later."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10552786742665241
    m_Localized: "So close. Next time I'll bring soap \u2014 might help."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10884899786448896
    m_Localized: Royal Charm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10884899853557760
    m_Localized: Enemy creatures get -1/-1, your creatures get +1/+1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10884899853557761
    m_Localized: Royal Bender
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10884899853557762
    m_Localized: Gain 2 mana and shuffle 10 Benders into your deck (each gives 2
      mana when drawn)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10884899853557763
    m_Localized: Eternal Bender
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10884899853557764
    m_Localized: 'At the start of the match: if your deck has no creatures, your
      minimum mana becomes 3 for the rest of the match. When drawn: gives 3 mana'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10884899853557765
    m_Localized: Bender
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10884899853557766
    m_Localized: 'When drawn: gives 2 mana'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11293883966152704
    m_Localized: 'On death: cast 3 random spells costing 3 or less'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11293884024872960
    m_Localized: 'On death: cast 5 random spells costing 5 or less'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11293884024872961
    m_Localized: 'On death: cast 10 random spells'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11514233782001664
    m_Localized: Sewer Breach
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11514233836527616
    m_Localized: Discard a creature, deal 3 damage to enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11514233836527617
    m_Localized: Cesspit Trash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11514233836527618
    m_Localized: 'When discarded: summon this creature and a copy of it'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11514233836527619
    m_Localized: Royal Pinata
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11514233836527620
    m_Localized: Dump Boss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11514233836527621
    m_Localized: 'When played: discards your cheapest card, shuffles 2 copies of
      it into your deck'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11514233836527622
    m_Localized: Take Out the Trash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11514233836527623
    m_Localized: 'Summons a 3/3/2 Trash. When discarded: summons another'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11514233836527624
    m_Localized: Trash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11514233836527625
    m_Localized: Salvage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11514233836527626
    m_Localized: Discard your cheapest card, deal damage to enemies equal to its
      cost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11641583169429504
    m_Localized: "Guest ID \u2014 sign in on the game website with it (My Collection)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11641583240732672
    m_Localized: Copy ID
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11641583240732673
    m_Localized: ID copied to clipboard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11641583244926976
    m_Localized: "Opponent is not responding\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11641583244926977
    m_Localized: Opponent disconnected
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11641583244926978
    m_Localized: Connection lost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11641583244926979
    m_Localized: Match ends in {0}s
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11641583244926980
    m_Localized: "Synchronizing\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11988063835119616
    m_Localized: Home Medic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11988064057417728
    m_Localized: 'At the end of turn: restores *5* health to your most wounded character'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11988064057417729
    m_Localized: Spitting Weed
    m_Metadata:
